    <item>
      <title>NRF 2026 零售業大展：AWS 引領零售數碼轉型的未來願景</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2026/01/19/nrf-2026-aws-retail-digital-transformation/genai-and-cloud/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=nrf-2026-aws-retail-digital-transformation</link>
      <description>全球零售業正處於轉型關鍵期。消費者行為急速轉變，全渠道購物體驗需求高漲，加上人工智能（AI）與雲端科技迅速普及，零售競爭版圖正被重新定義。作為雲端運算市場領導者，Amazon Web Services（AWS）將於明年舉行的全美零售聯盟（NRF）2026 大展上展示一系列針對零售業的創新方案，協助企業重塑營運模式，駕馭數碼轉型浪潮。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2026/01/19/nrf-2026-aws-retail-digital-transformation/genai-and-cloud/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=nrf-2026-aws-retail-digital-transformation</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://cdn.unwire.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/photo20260113154045-694x462.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2026 01:00:20 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
